---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="PeptiBloom — Beyond the research library"
  description="Discover PeptiBloom, its public research resources, and how to contact the project while keeping scientific and commercial information clearly separated."
>
  <section class="section section--hero">
    <div class="site-frame reading-column">
      <p class="eyebrow">PeptiBloom</p>
      <h1>Science first. A wider project around it.</h1>
      <p class="hero__lead">
        PeptiBloom brings together public scientific literacy, research tools and a developing brand ecosystem.
        The scientific library remains editorially separate from commercial information so that one never acts as evidence for the other.
      </p>
      <div class="hero__actions">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="#contact">Contact PeptiBloom</a>
        <a class="editorial-link" href="/research-basics/">Explore Research Basics <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--quiet" aria-labelledby="paths-title">
    <div class="site-frame">
      <div class="section-heading reading-column">
        <p class="eyebrow">Choose your path</p>
        <h2 id="paths-title">What are you looking for?</h2>
        <p>Different questions belong in different parts of PeptiBloom. Keeping those paths visible is part of the project’s transparency standard.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="path-grid">
        <article class="path-card">
          <p class="surface-kicker">Learn</p>
          <h3>Understand laboratory and peptide concepts</h3>
          <p>Short, source-aware explanations of COAs, HPLC, sterility, cold chain, lyophilization and other recurring research questions.</p>
          <a class="editorial-link" href="/research-basics/">Browse Research Basics <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="path-card">
          <p class="surface-kicker">Research</p>
          <h3>Follow the scientific publication standard</h3>
          <p>Compound-level scientific pages only appear after the required evidence and review path is complete.</p>
          <a class="editorial-link" href="/library/">Open the Scientific Library <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="path-card">
          <p class="surface-kicker">Tools</p>
          <h3>Check concentration arithmetic</h3>
          <p>Use the transparent calculator for unit conversions and concentration arithmetic without turning mathematics into a dosing recommendation.</p>
          <a class="editorial-link" href="/calculator/">Open the calculator <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <div class="site-frame contact-band">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
        <h2 id="contact-title">Talk to PeptiBloom.</h2>
        <p>For questions about PeptiBloom, availability or the wider project, choose the channel that works best for you.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-actions" aria-label="PeptiBloom contact channels">
        <a class="button button--primary" href="https://wa.me/34697947311?text=Hola%20PeptiBloom%2C%20he%20llegado%20desde%20la%20web%20y%20quer%C3%ADa%20hacer%20una%20consulta." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-conversion="whatsapp">Hablar por WhatsApp</a>
        <a class="button contact-email" href="mailto:info@peptibloomproject.com?subject=Consulta%20desde%20PeptiBloom" data-conversion="email">Escribir por email</a>
        <small>WhatsApp is the quickest contact path. Email: info@peptibloomproject.com</small>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--quiet" aria-labelledby="commercial-title">
    <div class="site-frame boundary-band">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Commercial boundary</p>
        <h2 id="commercial-title">Research content is not a product endorsement.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="reading-column">
        <p>
          PeptiBloom may publish separate commercial information and physical products. Those surfaces remain structurally distinct from scientific conclusions, evidence levels and Research Basics articles.
        </p>
        <p class="boundary-note"><strong>Important:</strong> contacting PeptiBloom about availability or a product does not change the evidence status of that product and does not constitute medical advice.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-conversion]').forEach((element) => {
    element.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const channel = element.dataset.conversion;
      window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('peptibloom:contact-click', { detail: { channel } }));
    });
  });
</script>

<style>
.path-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem;margin-top:2rem}.path-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem;padding:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.25rem);border:1px solid var(--color-hairline);border-radius:var(--radius-large);background:var(--color-paper);box-shadow:var(--shadow-paper)}.path-card h3,.path-card p{margin:0}.path-card .editorial-link{margin-top:auto}.contact-band{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.9fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,6rem);align-items:center}.contact-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:1rem;align-items:center;padding:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.5rem);border:1px solid var(--color-hairline);border-radius:var(--radius-large);background:var(--color-paper);box-shadow:var(--shadow-paper)}.contact-actions small{flex-basis:100%;color:var(--color-muted-ink)}.contact-email{background:transparent;color:var(--color-mulberry);border:1px solid var(--color-hairline)}.boundary-band{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.8fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(2rem,7vw,6rem);align-items:start}.boundary-note{padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-hairline);color:var(--color-muted-ink)}@media(max-width:800px){.path-grid,.contact-band,.boundary-band{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
